 128:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  *
 129:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * CAN driver provides transfer of CAN frames in accordance with CAN specificetion V2.0 B (active).
 130:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * can receive and transmit standard frames with 11-bit identifiers as well as extended frames with
 131:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * All CAN nodes share a common set of message objects. Each message object can be individually all
 132:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * CAN nodes.
 133:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * Besides serving as a storage container for incoming and outgoing frames, message objects can be 
 134:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * gateways between
 135:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * the CAN nodes or to setup a FIFO buffer. The CAN module provides Analyzer mode,Loop-back mode an
 136:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * node analysis.
 137:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  *
 138:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * The driver is divided into five sections:
 139:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * \par CAN Global features:
 140:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * -# Allows to configure module frequency using function XMC_CAN_Init().
 141:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * -# Allows to configure Module interrupt using configuration structure XMC_CAN_NODE_INTERRUPT_TRI
 142:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  *    XMC_CAN_EventTrigger().
