 150:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  *    and XMC_CAN_NODE_DisableEvent().
 151:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200F64K256BAXQSA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_can.h ****  * -# Provides bit timming analysis, configuration structure XMC_CAN_NODE_FRAME_COUNTER_t and funct
